{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A challenging Roguelite Dungeon crawl with auto-battling.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078920/extras/e4941caf90bda3a0121ec9655771010b.poster.avif?t=1760724494\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078920/extras/e4941caf90bda3a0121ec9655771010b.apng?t=1760724494\" class=\"bb_img\" width=96 height=32 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet again a mysterious evil stalks the land and yet again it seems only you can stop it. Everyone says &quot;He is coming&quot; but few say who &quot;He&quot; is. Some say the source of the lands troubles are a dragon or the Devil, others say its Death itself. The source of the worlds woes do seem to emanate from deep beneath a nearby crypt. It is down to you to descend through the bowels of an ever changing dungeon and destroy the foul being at its heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory will come through planning your route and combats wisely, strategic loot and event choices, daring and a little luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Descend through 20 randomised floors across 4 biomes. Plan your path wisely, make tough choices and enlist the help of mysterious strangers who wander the dungeon for their own purposes.\u00a0 Some runs will end in failure, but there will always be more heroes to take the place of the fallen.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Battle dozens of unique enemies and discover which\u00a0 of several end game evil beings is controlling them. Then take them down in an epic Boss fight against whichever power is at the root of the darkness. Only the mightiest will survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Ever changing, fast paced runs of ~ 30-40 minutes (Should you survive)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Permanently unlock new classes including (Not limited to) the armour destroying Vanguard or the nimble Assassin as well as a range of starting boons to tailor your run.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078920/extras/55c7f374b743b9a79652321bc9b5c30b.avif?t=1760724494\" width=398 height=148 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Discover countless run altering weapons, armour, trinkets and events.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078920/extras/d313b2e66dc852923286120fe41c5520.avif?t=1760724494\" width=352 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No two runs will ever be the same and death will be permanent and frequent. Do you have what it takes to descend?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4078920?t=1760724494","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4078920?t=1760724494","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078920/b80eed35256a9e1eecb60578e991d69887945f8f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760724494","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic