s be more heroes to take the place of the fallen.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Battle dozens of unique enemies and discover which\u00a0 of several end game evil beings is controlling them. Then take them down in an epic Boss fight against whichever power is at the root of the darkness. Only the mightiest will survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Ever changing, fast paced runs of ~ 30-40 minutes (Should you survive)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Permanently unlock new classes including (Not limited to) the armour destroying Vanguard or the nimble Assassin as well as a range of starting boons to tailor your run.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078920/extras/55c7f374b743b9a79652321bc9b5c30b.avif?t=1760724494\" width=398 height=148 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Discover countless run altering weapons, armour, trinkets and events.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4078920/extras/d313b2e66dc852923286120fe41c5520.avif?t=1760724494\" width=352 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No two runs will ever be the same and death will be permanent and frequent. Do you have what it takes to descend?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Kudos Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image"